<title>USA: Litton says U.S. Justice Dept. ends probe.</title>
<headline>Litton says U.S. Justice Dept. ends probe.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Litton Industries Inc said Monday the U.S. Department of Justice has informed it that the department has ended a criminal probe of Litton's Guidance &amp; Control Systems division in Woodland Hills without taking action against the company or its employees.</p>
<p>The investigation prompted a search of Litton's offices in Woodland Hills and Salt Lake City on March 27. Federal officials were seeking documents relating to Litton's cost estimating and pricing.</p>
</text>
